What happens when this runs?

```js
let s = 0;
for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) {
  s += i;
}
console.log(s, i);
```

What does this log?

```js
let n = 1, c = 0;
while (n < 20) {
  n *= 3;
  c++;
}
console.log(n, c);
```

What does this log?

```js
let d = 2;
switch (d) {
  case 1: console.log("Mon");
  case 2: console.log("Tue");
  case 3: console.log("Wed"); break;
  default: console.log("Other");
}
```

